stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> planned
    planned --> preparing: Inputs validated
    planned --> invalid_input: Manifest or refs incompatible
    preparing --> awaiting_trigger: Valid PR and manual trigger
    preparing --> awaiting_review: Valid PR and automatic trigger expected
    preparing --> needs_attention: Remote write ambiguous
    preparing --> failed: Permanent preparation error
    preparing --> invalid_input: Base or head incompatible
    awaiting_trigger --> awaiting_review: Trigger evidence attached
    awaiting_trigger --> needs_attention: Trigger result ambiguous
    awaiting_trigger --> timed_out: Deadline reached
    awaiting_review --> completed: First review frozen
    awaiting_review --> quota: Provider quota confirmed
    awaiting_review --> timed_out: Deadline reached without completion
    awaiting_review --> failed: Permanent capture error
    awaiting_review --> invalid_input: Verified SHA differs
    needs_attention --> preparing: PR reconciled
    needs_attention --> awaiting_review: Trigger confirmed
    needs_attention --> failed: Attempt closed with reason
    completed --> [*]
    quota --> [*]
    timed_out --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    invalid_input --> [*]
